Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ffmpeg
Recommends: mesa-va-drivers, intel-media-va-driver
Description: Zero-loss native file converter, archive suite, and Indian exam form tuner
 Mossambi is a universal high-performance native file conversion suite powered by
 a shared pure-Rust conversion engine with three user interfaces:
  * mossambi (UNIX-style CLI with stream-copy and mv grammar)
  * mossambi-tui (macOS-styled interactive terminal workspace)
  * mossambi-gui (Desktop studio with floating 8-carpel radial widget)
 Features 0.00% Zero-Loss mathematical remuxing, 100% scorecard Indian exam
 document optimization (UPSC, SSC, IBPS), and streaming file quality inspection.
